OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder of woman
OL,4,Ain Finglas
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has appeared in court charged
OL,7,Fwith the murder of a woman who was
OL,8,Ffound dead at a block of flats in the
OL,9,FRepublic of Ireland.
OL,11,FThe woman has been named locally as
OL,12,FLoredana Morosanu, who was in her 40s.
OL,14,FHer body was found at her home at
OL,15,FMelville Terrace in Finglas, County
OL,16,FDublin when gardai responded to an
OL,17,Fincident at the property at about 04.30
OL,18,Flocal time on Monday.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NI NewsC Reg TVF On This Day
