OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged with murder of woman
OL,4,Ain Finglas
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe court heard the accused,
OL,7,F47-year-old Daniel Simion Toader, who
OL,8,Fis Romanian, did not reply when gardai
OL,9,F(Irish police) charged him with murder.
